Package: nzcommute
Title: Reusable Tools for Directional Population-Weighted Commute Routing
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Yuxin", "Zhang", email = "yuxin@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides reusable functions for adaptive OD sampling, population-weighted meshblock point sampling, direction-specific routing, route-to-SA2 string conversion, transition aggregation, and road-segment traffic aggregation for commute-routing workflows.
